   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "2. Grain line (engine text): \"Produced Units (plant × region × MK) are summed over plants. Sales-implied production = Δ inventory + External invoiced units,\nsummed over every legal entity of the group. Own Region and Group invoices stay inside the group and net out. Comparison per bridge group × month; region summed,\nbreakdown shown.\"",
   "originalText": "2. Grain line (engine text): \"Produced Units (plant × region × MK) are summed over plants. Sales-implied production = Δ inventory + External invoiced units,\nsummed over every legal entity of the group. Own Region and Group invoices stay inside the group and net out. Comparison per bridge group × month; region summed,\nbreakdown shown.\"",
   "fontSize": 12,
